      "name": "Read Aloud",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<section class=\"sbn-leer\"><p>Third floor, above a closed-down hardware store. A one-bedroom apartment someone has turned into an investigation room: walls covered in maps stuck with red, blue, and yellow pins, mugs of cold coffee, an ashtray on the sill of the fire-escape window. On the desk, a stripped cable hangs plugged into nothing. The woman sitting on the floor, hood up, looks toward the door and doesn&#39;t seem surprised.</p>\n</section>\n"
      },
      "sort": 200000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 2
      },
      "flags": {
