    },
    {
      "_id": "3meYT7d2lxqu22X0",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!YD0Td8Y9aJyIpGSl.3meYT7d2lxqu22X0",
      "name": "Storyteller Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><strong>Layout:</strong> third-floor hallway (Gale Sentinel doorbells on every door), living room and kitchen, study with the maps and the creaking closet, bathroom, and a fire escape that lets out into the alley.</p>\n<p><strong>Clues:</strong> <button type=\"button\" class=\"sbn-pista\" data-sbn-pista=\"P-01\"><span class=\"sbn-pista-id\">P-01</span> <span class=\"sbn-pista-nombre\">Professional Mortal Thieves; Looped Cameras</span></button> (the camera lights), <button type=\"button\" class=\"sbn-pista\" data-sbn-pista=\"P-02\"><span class=\"sbn-pista-id\">P-02</span> <span class=\"sbn-pista-nombre\">Ghoul Vitae on the Doorknob</span></button> (ghoul Vitae on the doorknob; spotted with <a class=\"sbn-tirada\" data-sbn-tirada=\"attributes.wits skills.awareness\" data-dificultad=\"3\" data-label=\"Wits + Awareness (Difficulty 3)\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-dice-d10\"></i> Wits + Awareness (Difficulty 3)</a>, or with Auspex). In the hallway, the camera at 3B is still streaming.</p>\n<p><strong>Scenes:</strong> @UUID[JournalEntry.w9xeQJg6psfiMjFU.JournalEntryPage.yyXMKcpDOIhGuZIB]{A0-E01 · The Call from SAFE} and @UUID[JournalEntry.5hwXPdn0tUJ3NaKZ.JournalEntryPage.T8gJWjZpOnL4OisP]{A1-E01 · What They Took}.</p>\n<p><strong>Careful:</strong> any visible use of Disciplines in front of @UUID[JournalEntry.fVXK7vOoqn0ZL0uf]{Helen} sets @UUID[JournalEntry.AnZpyM4onyACPwiC.JournalEntryPage.j1wUSqY1dsP0iFfp]{GAN-02 · The Night She Beholds the Beast} in motion.</p>\n"
      },
